# Shelly energy meters on the shop LAN, polled by the /admin/power dashboard.
# Format: "Име=host" pairs separated by commas; a bare host labels itself.
# Leave blank to disable the dashboard. Give each meter a DHCP reservation -
# a lease can move and these are addressed by IP.
SHELLY_DEVICES=Главно табло=192.168.18.72
